# Online 1v1 relay (PartyKit). Leave unset for local two-tab testing with `npx partykit dev`
# (defaults to localhost:1999). For real online play, deploy the relay (`npx partykit deploy`)
# and set this to the deployed host, then run the web app with it, e.g.:
#   VITE_PARTYKIT_HOST=rigbound.<your-partykit-username>.partykit.dev npm run dev
# VITE_PARTYKIT_HOST=rigbound.YOURNAME.partykit.dev
